{"id":595,"slug":"lola","title":"Lola","year":1981,"country":"West Germany","duration":115,"spine":206,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/595-lola","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/3ea71dbfe24a1936540736e60139c6e3/iPiAJqoeZqtJqa9oDC0dedP1Xff6tt_large.jpg","description":"Germany in the autumn of 1957: Lola (Barbara Sukowa), a seductive cabaret singer–prostitute, exults in her power as a tempter of men, but she wants more—money, property, and love. Pitting a corrupt building contractor (Mario Adorf) against the new straight-arrow building commissioner (Armin Mueller-Stahl), Lola launches an outrageous plan to elevate herself in a world where everything—and everyone—is for sale. Shot in childlike candy colors, Rainer Werner Fassbinder’s Lola, an homage to Josef von Sternberg’s classic The Blue Angel, is a wonderfully satirical tribute to capitalism. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Rainer Werner Fassbinder","slug":"rainer-werner-fassbinder"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Barbara Sukowa","role":"Lola","slug":"barbara-sukowa"},{"actor":"Armin Mueller-Stahl","role":"Von Bohm","slug":"armin-mueller-stahl"},{"actor":"Mario Adorf","role":"Schuckert","slug":"mario-adorf"},{"actor":"Matthias Fuchs","role":"Esslin","slug":"matthias-fuchs"},{"actor":"Helga Feddersen","role":"Mrs. Hettich","slug":"helga-feddersen"},{"actor":"Karin Baal","role":"Lola's mother","slug":"karin-baal"},{"actor":"Ivan Desny","role":"Wittich","slug":"ivan-desny"},{"actor":"Elisabeth Volkmann","role":"Gigi","slug":"elisabeth-volkmann"},{"actor":"Hark Bohm","role":"Völker","slug":"hark-bohm"},{"actor":"Karl-Heinz von Hassel","role":"Timmerding","slug":"karl-heinz-von-hassel"},{"actor":"Rosel Zech","role":"Mrs. Schuckert","slug":"rosel-zech"},{"actor":"Christine Kaufmann","role":"Susi","slug":"christine-kaufmann"},{"actor":"Y Sa Lo","role":"Rosa","slug":"y-sa-lo"},{"actor":"Günther Kaufmann","role":"GI","slug":"gunther-kaufmann-2"},{"actor":"Isolde Barth","role":"Mrs. Völk